<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There is a place of comfort sweet,</l><l>Near to the heart of God,</l><l>A place where we our Savior meet,</l><l>Near to the heart of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>There is a place of full release,</l><l>Near to the heart of God,</l><l>A place where all is joy and peace,</l><l>Near to the heart of God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
